# Lab Architecture

I designed my home lab to generate Windows events, forward them to Splunk, and investigate the collected security logs.

flowchart TD
    A[VirtualBox] --> B[Windows Server 2022]
    B --> C[Active Directory]
    B --> D[Windows Event Logs]
    D --> E[Splunk Universal Forwarder]
    E --> F[Splunk Enterprise]
    F --> G[SPL Searches]
    G --> H[Security Monitoring and Investigation]
